{"nodes": [{"id": "brain_log_78_interval_calibration_regime_result_numerics_regime", "label": "Environment numerics regime (.venv-forecast vs .venv-eval)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "brain/log/78_interval_calibration_regime_result.md", "source_location": "lines 1-70", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Characterised rather than avoided: two runs, one to confirm reproduction and stamp provenance, one to measure the sensitivity log/61 observed by accident so its magnitude can be stated instead of left as a footnote."}, {"id": "brain_log_78_interval_calibration_regime_result_inferred_regime_phrasing", "label": "Inferred-regime reporting condition", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/log/78_interval_calibration_regime_result.md", "source_location": "lines 10-25", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A clean reproduction confirms consistency with the regime log/61 INFERRED; it does not establish that the committed numbers were produced there. Phrasing is fixed as 'reproduces under the regime log/61 identifies as committed', never 'the regime question is closed'."}, {"id": "brain_log_78_interval_calibration_regime_result_stamp_split", "label": "Stamp split \u2014 markdown stamped, JSON not", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "brain/log/78_interval_calibration_regime_result.md", "source_location": "lines 20-25, 205-215", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "stamp_lines() was wired into the markdown writer before runtime_stamp() reached the JSON payloads, so an unstamped-artefact count built from one output family under-reports; the sweep was redone across both. eval/interval_calibration.py was the sole genuine case."}, {"id": "brain_log_78_interval_calibration_regime_result_same_name_different_number", "label": "Two numbers with the same name are not the same number", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/log/78_interval_calibration_regime_result.md", "source_location": "lines 57-66", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A per-level clamp counter was misread as the headline sweep-level count, producing a false drift conclusion; the resolution was to open the markdown rather than reason about why the JSON disagreed."}, {"id": "brain_log_78_interval_calibration_regime_result_unstamped_mcs_risk", "label": "Residual risk sits in the unstamped MCS verdicts", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/log/78_interval_calibration_regime_result.md", "source_location": "lines 231-241", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Point estimates are stable to three significant figures, but three of the four unrecorded-regime clusters contain an MCS, and set-membership/exclusion verdicts computed from them could flip. Recorded, not resolved \u2014 resolving means a separate approval to re-run."}, {"id": "brain_log_78_interval_calibration_regime_result_markdown_recovery_route", "label": "Stamped markdown as the regime recovery route", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "brain/log/78_interval_calibration_regime_result.md", "source_location": "lines 223-230", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Seven markdown artefacts carry a stamp and are the recovery route for anything sharing a generator; ladder_results markdown carries none because the ladder deliberately will not be re-run."}], "edges": [{"source": "brain_log_78_interval_calibration_regime_result_numerics_regime", "target": "brain_log_78_interval_calibration_regime_result_inferred_regime_phrasing", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "brain/log/78_interval_calibration_regime_result.md", "source_location": "lines 10-25", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "brain_log_78_int